---
title: "Residents & Frog Pond | Hopscotch"
layout: base.njk
permalink: /shrines/animalcrossing/newhorizons/residents/
customcss: '/assets/css/acnh/hopscotch.css'
---
<main class="hs-shell hs-residents">
  {% include "acnh/nav.njk" %}
  <header class="hs-page-hero hs-page-hero--pink"><div><span class="hs-eyebrow">the neighbourhood</span><h1>Meet the residents <span aria-hidden="true">♡</span></h1><p>The little faces who make Hopscotch feel like home—and all the frog villagers I hope to meet.</p></div><div class="hs-page-hero__stamp"><strong>{{ acnh.villagers.current | length }}</strong><span>of 10<br>neighbours</span></div></header>

  <section class="hs-section" aria-labelledby="resident-heading"><div class="hs-section-title"><div><span class="hs-eyebrow">currently calling hopscotch home</span><h2 id="resident-heading">My neighbours</h2></div><span class="hs-section-title__decoration">✿</span></div>
    <div class="hs-villager-grid">
      {% for villager in acnh.villagers.current %}
      <article class="hs-villager {% if villager.frog %}hs-villager--frog{% endif %}">
        <div class="hs-villager__photo">{% if villager.image %}<img src="{{ villager.image }}" alt="{{ villager.name }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}<span aria-hidden="true">🌿</span>{% endif %}</div>
        <div class="hs-villager__info"><h3>{{ villager.name }} {% if villager.frog %}<span title="Frog neighbour" aria-label="Frog neighbour">🐸</span>{% endif %}</h3><span>{{ villager.personality or 'Neighbour' }}</span>{% if villager.photo %}<small>♡ photo collected</small>{% endif %}{% if villager.movedIn %}<small>Arrived {{ villager.movedIn }}</small>{% endif %}</div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hs-section hs-pond" aria-labelledby="frog-heading"><div class="hs-section-title"><div><span class="hs-eyebrow">the most important collection</span><h2 id="frog-heading">The Frog Pond 🐸</h2><p>Every New Horizons frog, with a special spot for the ones I've welcomed home.</p></div><div class="hs-frog-total"><strong>{{ acnh.villagers.frogs | selectattr("status", "equalto", "current") | list | length }}</strong><span>/ {{ acnh.villagers.frogs | length }} frogs living here</span></div></div>
    <div class="hs-frog-grid">{% for frog in acnh.villagers.frogs %}<article class="hs-frog-tile hs-frog-tile--{{ frog.status or 'missing' }}">{% if frog.image %}<img src="{{ frog.image }}" alt="{{ frog.name }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}<span aria-hidden="true">🐸</span>{% endif %}<h3>{{ frog.name }}</h3><span class="hs-frog-state">{% if frog.status == 'hotel' %}Hotel VIP{% else %}{{ frog.status or 'missing' }}{% endif %}</span></article>{% endfor %}</div>
    <div class="hs-legend"><span><i class="hs-dot hs-dot--current"></i> Here now</span><span><i class="hs-dot hs-dot--past"></i> Past neighbour</span><span><i class="hs-dot hs-dot--dreamie"></i> Dreamie</span><span><i class="hs-dot hs-dot--missing"></i> Not met yet</span><span><i class="hs-dot hs-dot--hotel"></i> Hotel VIP</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="hs-section hs-two-up" aria-label="Neighbourhood memories and wishes">
    <div class="hs-panel"><div class="hs-section-title"><div><span class="hs-eyebrow">old friends</span><h2>Former residents</h2></div><span aria-hidden="true">📦</span></div>
      {% if acnh.villagers.past and acnh.villagers.past.length %}<div class="hs-mini-villager-grid">{% for villager in acnh.villagers.past %}<div class="hs-mini-villager">{% if villager.image %}<img src="{{ villager.image }}" alt="{{ villager.name }}" loading="lazy">{% endif %}<div><strong>{{ villager.name }}</strong><small>{{ villager.personality or 'Former neighbour' }}</small></div></div>{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<p>No departures recorded yet.</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="hs-panel"><div class="hs-section-title"><div><span class="hs-eyebrow">one day...</span><h2>Dreamies</h2></div><span aria-hidden="true">💌</span></div>
      {% if acnh.villagers.dreamies and acnh.villagers.dreamies.length %}<div class="hs-mini-villager-grid">{% for villager in acnh.villagers.dreamies %}<div class="hs-mini-villager">{% if villager.image %}<img src="{{ villager.image }}" alt="{{ villager.name }}" loading="lazy">{% endif %}<div><strong>{{ villager.name }}</strong><small>{{ villager.note or 'On my wish list' }}</small></div></div>{% endfor %}</div>{% else %}<div class="hs-empty-cute"><span>💭</span><p>No dreamies pinned just yet. There's always room for another frog on the wishlist!</p></div>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  {% if acnh.villagers.hotelGuests and acnh.villagers.hotelGuests.length %}
  <section class="hs-section hs-hotel-visitors" aria-labelledby="hotel-heading">
    <div class="hs-section-title"><div><span class="hs-eyebrow">visiting frogs get the VIP treatment</span><h2 id="hotel-heading">The hotel guestbook 🌸</h2><p>Froggy friends who came to stay, with a little room all their own.</p></div><span class="hs-section-title__decoration">✿</span></div>
    <div class="hs-hotel-grid">
      {% for guest in acnh.villagers.hotelGuests %}
      <article class="hs-hotel-card hs-panel">
        <div class="hs-hotel-card__intro">
          {% if guest.image %}<img class="hs-hotel-card__portrait" src="{{ guest.image }}" alt="{{ guest.name }}" loading="lazy">{% endif %}
          <div><span class="hs-hotel-card__badge">♡ hotel VIP · not a resident</span><h3>{{ guest.name }}</h3>{% if guest.roomTheme %}<p>{{ guest.roomTheme }}</p>{% endif %}</div>
        </div>
        {% if guest.roomImage %}<img class="hs-hotel-card__room" src="{{ guest.roomImage }}" alt="{{ guest.name }}'s themed hotel suite" loading="lazy">{% endif %}
        {% if guest.note %}<p class="hs-hotel-card__note">{{ guest.note }}</p>{% endif %}
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <footer class="hs-footer">Villager icon credit: <a href="https://nookipedia.com/wiki/Category:New_Horizons_character_icons">Nookipedia</a> · made with love ♡</footer>
</main>
